### Requires the session cookie created by requests/listener-actions.http.

### Get recommendations for the authenticated listener
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations?page=0&size=20

### Rebuild 100 recommendations and return the first page. Run the CSRF request first.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations/rebuild?page=0&size=20
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfToken}}
